- Preserve the existing TQS/Studio architecture unless acceptance or a proven technical boundary requires change.
- Reuse existing components/data paths and mature maintained libraries before custom replacements.
- You may improve reversible implementation details autonomously if MUST/MUST NOT and acceptance remain satisfied.
- Verify targeted tests/build and real browser/runtime behavior for user-visible work.
- Do not call self-report/build/deploy READY a product PASS without observable acceptance.
