## Studio quality reset

- If the task touches Studio, read the latest private Studio Product Contract and Execution gate before design decisions. The owner must not be asked to re-explain recurring Studio goals.
- Treat the current owner-rejected Portal Rooms/Documents visuals as disposable presentation, not as a style baseline.
- Fix canonical persistence before further visual celebration: production live-state read/write and fresh-session readback are P0.
- Major visual work is reference-first: compare actual runtime screenshots against explicit Board and Document target screens using the accepted Trading Workspace visual DNA.
- Do not return `OWNER REVIEW REQUIRED` with any known self-fixable P0/P1 issue, local-only truth, `Не записалось`, live-state 404/403, or unresolved major visual-quality defect.
- Keep iterating inside the same outcome until runtime, persistence, visual QA and regression gates pass.
